:</b> Creator places one <a href='https://www.allbirds.com/products/mens-tree-runners'>Men&#x27;s Tree Runner</a> on a digital kitchen scale with a deadpan expression.</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>VO:</b> “Eight point six ounces.”</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>On-screen text:</b> 8.6 oz</p></div><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;font-weight:bold;margin:12pt 0 3pt 0;'>Scene 2 (Tension)</p><div style='margin-left:14pt;'><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>Visual:</b> Creator looks down at the digital scale readout, then looks up at the camera shaking his head in disbelief.</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>VO:</b> “Thought that was a typo.”</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>On-screen text:</b> First-time buyer skepticism</p></div><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;font-weight:bold;margin:12pt 0 3pt 0;'>Scene 3 (Turn)</p><div style='margin-left:14pt;'><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>Visual:</b> Creator squeezes the black knit upper of the <a href='https://www.allbirds.com/products/mens-tree-runners'>Men&#x27;s Tree Runner</a>, showing the texture of the eucalyptus tree fiber up close.</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>VO:</b> “Upper is made with eucalyptus tree fiber.”</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>On-screen text:</b> Eucalyptus tree fiber</p></div><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;font-weight:bold;margin:12pt 0 3pt 0;'>Scene 4 (Proof)</p><div style='margin-left:14pt;'><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>Visual:</b> Creator steps outside onto the pavement wearing both shoes for a walk, smiling slightly as he tests the flexibility.</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>VO:</b> “Perfect for casual walking.”</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>On-screen text:</b> Everyday casual wear</p></div><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;font-weight:bold;margin:12pt 0 3pt 0;'>Scene 5 (Payoff)</p><div style='margin-left:14pt;'><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>Visual:</b> Creator holds up his phone showing the product page with the price, nodding to the camera.</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>VO:</b> “One hundred dollars. Size up.”</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>On-screen text:</b> $100.00 | Size up</p></div><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;font-weight:bold;margin:12pt 0 3pt 0;'>Scene 6 (Gift and CTA)</p><div style='margin-left:14pt;'><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>Visual:</b> Creator drops the shoe back into its box on the kitchen counter, taps the phone screen, and points down.</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>VO:</b> “Hard to take off. Tap below to buy.”</p><p style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 3pt 0;'><b>On-screen text:</b> <a hr